  "interpretation_zh": "稠密 full-DCT K2 在五相机和九相机两臂均达到 1313/1313 严格安全单元与 13/13 完整标定组，说明这个稠密起点再做一步 CGLS 的诊断精度充足。但冻结的 Zero-K4 参考在两臂均为 0/1313 和 0/13，不具备作为接受参考的基本精度。",
  "interpretation_en": "Dense full-DCT K2 reaches 1313/1313 strict-safe cells and 13/13 complete calibration groups in both sensor arms, showing that this dense starting point followed by one additional CGLS step is diagnostically accurate. However, the frozen Zero-K4 reference reaches 0/1313 cells and 0/13 groups in both arms and is not an adequate accepted reference.",
  "decision_boundary_zh": "v196.1 独立确认 v196 与 v176 使用同一五相机 Zero-K4 物理参考：156 个重叠指标最大差 5.55e-17，两份保留场逐位一致；而 v176 在 v196 冻结前已封存该参考为 0/52。v175 的参考也曾在候选过门时为 0/468。故 v196 的‘参考任一失败即 inconclusive’分支在冻结前已被旧证据预定触发。v196 数值和原判决仍有效，但它不能称为前瞻性的比较 headroom 试验。",
  "decision_boundary_en": "v196.1 independently confirms that v196 and v176 use the same five-camera Zero-K4 physical reference: all 156 overlapping metrics agree within 5.55e-17 and two retained fields are bitwise identical. Yet v176 had already sealed that reference at 0/52 before v196 was frozen, while v175 had also labeled a 0/468 arm as a reference when its candidate passed. The v196 branch stating that any reference failure forces an inconclusive verdict was therefore predetermined by pre-freeze evidence. The v196 numerics and original verdict remain valid, but it is not a prospective comparative-headroom test.",
  "route_action": "Preserve the original v196 decision and retain full-DCT K2 only as a post-open absolute-capacity diagnostic. Do not replace the reference post hoc. Before evaluating another candidate, separately freeze and independently establish a non-exchangeable reference that already satisfies the absolute adequacy gate. Keep p14, tests, resource measurement, predictor training, neural training, and GPU use closed.",
